From 69390afde7847ae68145f34b03495690d319a427 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 08:22:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(sessions): prioritize title search and expose sidebar
 failures [daveey]

Search ID, then title, then message content, preserving source filters, lineage dedup and limits. Show a localized retry alert on full-store search failure even with loaded-page matches.

Proof: crowded real-DB regression fails on baseline with/without ID match, then 15 backend tests pass. Hook RED to GREEN; 10 renderer tests, renderer tsc and full scripts/check pass. Existing policy assertion updated to title-first; membership/exclusion checks retained.
